A small Yagi for Wifi

Video documentation:
https://youtu.be/t9evcC67pFQ

There are dxf files for Laser Cutters and stl file for 3D printing.

The parasitics lengths are (1.5mm copper wire)
#1: 55mm
#2: 55mm
#3: 56mm

The Reflector length is: (1.5mm copper wire)
 60mm (connect to signal ground)
 
The dipole is 0.75 to 1mm silver coated copper wire
 Dipole is wound over the dipole jig, thread wire through 
 the 2 small holes in the jig. Make sure the 2 ends don't touch. 

Use a 1/4 wave (2.44 Ghz) impedance match.
 20mm shielded signal cable (cut from connection pigtail)
